{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"content_direction":"column","gap":32,"color_scheme":"","padding-block-start":40,"padding-block-end":80}},"section_qreVqn":{"type":"section","blocks":{"text_6qmgVq":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<h1>Il était une soie<\/h1>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_YJ78ER":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Il était une soie française qui, éteinte depuis le siècle dernier, naquit à nouveau.<\/p><p>L’histoire d’une relocalisation dans un monde où tout est fait là-bas, consommé ici, en abîmant partout.<\/p><p>L'histoire du Sud brut. A l’âge d’or de la soie, les paysans y portaient un <em>moucadou del col<\/em> (\"mouchoir de cou\" en occitan).<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_6qmgVq","text_YJ78ER"],"name":"Title banner","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","padding-block-start":80,"padding-block-end":80}},"media_with_content_4EcWTe":{"type":"media-with-content","blocks":{"media":{"type":"_media-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"media_type":"image","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/picstloup.jpg","link":"","video_loop":true,"video_autoplay":false,"image_position":"cover","video_position":"cover"},"blocks":{}},"content":{"type":"_content-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"space-between","gap":24},"blocks":{"group_G6Gp3P":{"type":"group","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_gK8AUH":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<h1>1095<\/h1><h1>La légende de Saint Loup<\/h1>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"h2","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_FQzWir":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Eté 1095. Les trois frères Loup, Guiral et Clair tombent amoureux de la même femme, Irène. ​​Indécise, elle promet son cœur à celui qui, au cours de la Croisade, se montrera le plus courageux.<\/p><p>Lorsque les trois chevaliers reviennent de Terre Sainte, ils croisent un long convoi funèbre. Irène s'est consumée d’amour. Inconsolables, ils décident de vivre en ermites au sommet de trois montagnes.<\/p><p>Loup, revenu avec de la soie d’Orient et de curieuses graines, les offre à ses amis cévenols. Ils étudient minutieusement les chenilles qui en éclosent et leurs cocons.<\/p><p>A chaque anniversaire de la mort d’Irène, les frères allument un grand feu en sa mémoire. Les années passent et, un à un, ils cessent d'illuminer le Mont Saint-Clair, le Rocher de Saint-Guiral et le Pic Saint-Loup, qui portent encore leur nom.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_gK8AUH","text_FQzWir"]}},"block_order":["group_G6Gp3P"]}},"name":"t:names.editorial","settings":{"media_position":"left","media_width":"medium","media_height":"60svh","section_width":"full-width","extend_media":true,"color_scheme":"scheme-2","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"media_with_content_Pt8QP8":{"type":"media-with-content","blocks":{"media":{"type":"_media-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"media_type":"image","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/histoire.jpg","link":"","video_loop":true,"video_autoplay":false,"image_position":"cover","video_position":"cover"},"blocks":{}},"content":{"type":"_content-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"space-between","gap":24},"blocks":{"group_dPkJbA":{"type":"group","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_fyhKdH":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<h2>1853<\/h2><h2>L'âge d'or de la soie<\/h2>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"h2","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_xD8GhJ":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Du XIIe au XIXe siècle, beaucoup de foyers paysans du Sud de la France cultivent des vers à soie. <\/p><p>En 1853, la France produit 26.000 tonnes de soie, dont la moitié des Cévennes jusqu’au Pic Saint Loup.<\/p><p>Puis la production s'éteint. La maladie des vers d’abord, soignée par Pasteur. La concurrence du nylon ensuite, puis les délocalisations. Des milliers d'emplois disparaissent dans le silence.<\/p><p>Plus aucun fil de soie n’est d’origine française. Jusqu'à la création de SAINT LOUP.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_fyhKdH","text_xD8GhJ"]}},"block_order":["group_dPkJbA"]}},"name":"t:names.editorial","settings":{"media_position":"right","media_width":"medium","media_height":"60svh","section_width":"full-width","extend_media":true,"color_scheme":"scheme-2","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"media_with_content_VQyRJE":{"type":"media-with-content","blocks":{"media":{"type":"_media-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"media_type":"image","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/elisa_8bb66e2c-763b-4bf8-8c1c-25b2ba22d4a9.jpg","link":"","video_loop":true,"video_autoplay":false,"image_position":"cover","video_position":"cover"},"blocks":{}},"content":{"type":"_content-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"space-between","gap":24},"blocks":{"group_Jrd46R":{"type":"group","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_fzyKga":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<h2>2025<\/h2><h2>La résurrection de la soie<\/h2>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"h2","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_hPdxmY":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>L'héritage de la soie française ne tient qu'à un fil. <\/p><p>Il suffit pourtant de deux papillons amoureux.​ Avant de mourir, la femelle Bombyx pond 500 œufs, qui deviendront des vers à soie nourris de feuilles de mûrier blanc. Leurs 500 cocons, une fois déroulés, donnent plus de 500 km de soie. De quoi tisser un foulard.<\/p><p>En 2025, un retour aux sources est orchestré par Michel, un sériciculteur passionné, et Alexandre, un entrepreneur social ayant grandi au pied du Pic Saint-Loup. Le savoir-faire séricicole se transmet et se réinvente avec excellence, des mûriers jusqu'aux carrés de soie.​​<\/p><p>La même année, SAINT LOUP fabrique le premier foulard de soie française depuis le siècle dernier. En quelques jours, les premiers exemplaires, numérotés, sont en rupture de stock. <\/p><p>L'aventure (re)commence.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_fzyKga","text_hPdxmY"]}},"block_order":["group_Jrd46R"]}},"name":"t:names.editorial","settings":{"media_position":"left","media_width":"medium","media_height":"60svh","section_width":"full-width","extend_media":true,"color_scheme":"scheme-2","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"section_yedLMU":{"type":"section","blocks":{"text_GTQWTL":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p>Presse<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"h1","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_Q3Y3UG":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p><\/p><p><a href=\"\/pages\/presse\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Presse\">SAINT LOUP est dans la presse (cliquer ici)<\/a><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"paragraph","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":30,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_GTQWTL","text_Q3Y3U